---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Setup & Quick Start Guide" currentPath="/docs/getting-started/quick-start">
  <div class="space-y-8 font-mono text-xs">
    <div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-semibold mb-1">GETTING STARTED</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-sans">Setup & Quick Start Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm font-sans mt-1">5 flexible ways to integrate RouteNex into your applications, SDKs, agents, and IDEs.</p>
    </div>

    {/* Section 1: Direct REST API */}
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Direct REST API (/v1/chat/completions & /v1/messages)</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Send requests directly to RouteNex. Use <code class="text-zinc-200">model: "auto"</code> for deterministic auto-routing, or append OpenRouter tags like <code class="text-zinc-200">:free</code> or <code class="text-zinc-200">:nitro</code>:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-300 overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed">
        <pre><code>curl http://localhost:3001/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer rn-local-dev-default" \
  -d '&#123;
    "model": "auto:free",
    "messages": [
      &#123; "role": "user", "content": "Explain quantum teleportation in 2 sentences" &#125;
    ]
  &#125;'</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Section 2: Drop-in OpenAI & Anthropic SDKs */}
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Drop-in OpenAI & Anthropic SDK Replacement</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Switch your existing OpenAI SDK client by updating only two parameters:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-300 overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed">
        <pre><code>from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(
    base_url="http://127.0.0.1:3001/v1",  # Local daemon or https://api.routenex.com/v1
    api_key="rn-local-dev-default"        # Or your scoped virtual key
)

response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="auto",
    messages=[&#123;"role": "user", "content": "Optimize this SQL query"&#125;]
)
print(response.choices[0].message.content)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Section 3: Agent Tool Execution Loop */}
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Multi-Turn Agent Tool Execution Loop</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        RouteNex preserves full tool definitions, JSON schemas, and function calls across fallback boundaries:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-300 overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed">
        <pre><code>response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="combo/coding-power",
    messages=[&#123;"role": "user", "content": "What is the weather in Tokyo?"&#125;],
    tools=[&#123;
        "type": "function",
        "function": &#123;
            "name": "get_weather",
            "description": "Fetch real-time weather",
            "parameters": &#123;
                "type": "object",
                "properties": &#123;"location": &#123;"type": "string"&#125;&#125;,
                "required": ["location"]
            &#125;
        &#125;
    &#125;]
)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Section 4: One-Command Agent CLI */}
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">4</span>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">One-Command Coding Agent CLI Launcher</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Launch your favorite coding agents with isolated per-process environment variables:
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-200">
          <code>routenex run claude --model auto</code>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-200">
          <code>routenex run cursor</code>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-200">
          <code>routenex run cline</code>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-200">
          <code>routenex run aider --model combo/coding-power</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Section 5: Remote & Local MCP Server */}
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">5</span>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Connect Claude Code, Cursor, or Cline to RouteNex’s built-in MCP server for live model inspection and combo management:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#09090b] border border-[#222226] text-zinc-300 space-y-2">
        <div>
          <span className="text-zinc-500 block text-[10px]">Stdio Mode (Claude Desktop / Cursor):</span>
          <code>routenex --mcp</code>
        </div>
        <div className="pt-2 border-t border-[#222226]">
          <span className="text-zinc-500 block text-[10px]">Remote HTTP / SSE Endpoint:</span>
          <code>POST http://127.0.0.1:3001/v1/mcp</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
